# Tayam, Luminous Enigma's ability mills three cards and then returns a permanent card with mana value 3 or less "from your
# graveyard" - if there is one. Three vigilance counters (Ornithopter's, Birds of Paradise's, Llanowar Elves', each put by
# Tayam as they entered) pay its cost; the mill puts Lightning Bolt, Argothian Elder (mana value 4) and Counterspell into an
# otherwise empty graveyard, none of which qualifies, so nothing is asked and nothing returns.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Tayam, Luminous Enigma
Ornithopter
Birds of Paradise
Plains
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Argothian Elder
Counterspell
Plains x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

